        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In the Southwest, the tradition of making, wearing and trading real turquoise jewelry is embedded in our way of life. At T.Skies, we honor the artistry and craftsmanship of this timeless art form. We create pieces that feel like you.</p>"
